  <!-- EN: crypto double bed -->
  <sd_cryo_double_bed.label>加密双人床</sd_cryo_double_bed.label>
  <!-- EN: A comfy crypto bed. Fits two. During the research of cryptosleep the possibilty of a short sleeping cycle based on this technology emerged. However most people still refuse to use these beds in fear of never waking up or losing several years by accident. This lead to several Rimworld legends. Although all exposed by scientists as fictional storys many people fear the device. -->
  <sd_cryo_double_bed.description>一张舒适的加密睡眠床。可容纳两人。在研究加密睡眠技术期间，人们发现基于该技术可能实现短睡眠周期。然而，大多数人仍因担心永远无法醒来或意外失去数年时光而拒绝使用这些床。这由此催生了若干《RimWorld》传说。尽管科学家们已证实这些都是虚构的故事，但许多人仍对该设备心存恐惧。</sd_cryo_double_bed.description>
  <!-- EN: space double bed -->
  <sd_space_double_bed.label>太空双人床</sd_space_double_bed.label>
  <!-- EN: A comfy bed. Fits two. On the task of "going to space" this bed was literally first developed as a small spacecraft. After this fatal first mistake the possibility to sleep inside and a bit more comfort was added. This didn't prevent the advertising agency from using the terms "fly in your sleep" and "sleeping on clouds". After several lawsuits from customers with strange injuries the advertisment changed to a more down-to-earth direction. -->
  <sd_space_double_bed.description>一张舒适的床。可容纳两人。在“进军太空”的开发任务中，这张床最初确实是作为一艘小型飞船设计的。在犯下这一致命的初级错误后，开发者才增加了在床内睡觉的功能，并稍作舒适度提升。但这并未阻止广告公司使用“睡着也能飞”和“如睡云端”等宣传语。 在遭遇数起因顾客遭受奇怪伤害而提起的诉讼后，广告宣传转向了更接地气的方向。</sd_space_double_bed.description>
</LanguageData>